["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/SupportType/deployed", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "In addition to being supported by the supplier, the software is known to have been deployed and is in use. For a software as a service provider, this implies the software is now available as a service.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/hsCodes", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The [Harmonized System (HS)](https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/nomenclature/overview/what-is-the-harmonized-system.aspx) of tariff nomenclature is an internationally standardized system of names and numbers, defined by the World Customs Organization, used to classify traded products.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Dataset/DatasetType/timeseries", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Data is recorded in an ordered sequence of timestamped entries, such as the price of a stock over the course of a day.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/definitionSource", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "It is the authoritative or credible entity, document, or body of knowledge that provides the meaning of a type, ensuring accuracy, context, and standardization.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
